    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating multiple Python files for a structured document extraction project. The files are categorized into same-scenario, local helper, and later-step files. Each scored implementation file must use a concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in the code. I will use Amazon Textract for document extraction, Amazon Comprehend for text moderation, Amazon Translate for translation, and Amazon DynamoDB for document storage. </thinking>\n",
